# --- TPILOT TDATA/SESSION IMPORT ADMINBOT UI 20260719 START ---
#
# UI-only wiring for the third manager-onboarding authorization method
# ("📦 Через tdata / session"). All real processing happens in the controller
# via /manager_tdimport_start|status|confirm|cancel (main.py) and the
# isolated tdata_import\ backend package -- this block only: shows the entry
# button (added to _manager_qr_entry_button above, appearing on every "choose
# auth method" screen the QR button already appears on), receives the
# uploaded ZIP document, and renders safe status/confirm/error screens.
#
# Does NOT touch phone/code/2FA or QR internals -- those handlers are
# untouched. A brand new NewMessage handler receives the document (panel_bot.py
# had zero file-upload handling before this); a brand new dedicated
# CallbackQuery handler (matching the existing _pbuy_callback/
# _frompool_callback/_ppool_callback precedent of several independent
# CallbackQuery handlers coexisting) reacts only to wiz:tdimport_* prefixes.
#
# SECURITY: only safe fields ever reach a Telegram message here -- masked
# phone, username, display name, tg_user_id, dc_id, the externally-verified
# proxy IP. No auth_key/2FA/API-hash/full-phone/proxy-password ever appears
# in any string sent to chat.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

